            "review_text": "Windy Dao\nUnited States2 contributions\n0\nMust try this place\nOct 2025 • Solo\nI had a meal alone at Com Ngon Siba, and I was truly impressed! The staff were extremely attentive and friendly, making me feel comfortable from start to finish. The restaurant is clean and cozy - perfect for solo dining or sharing a meal with friends and family. The rice dishes were delicious - perfectly cooked rice, flavorful side dishes, and beautiful presentation. I also found out that Siba has several locations, which makes it super convenient to visit again. Definitely worth trying, and I’ll surely come back!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nCrispy pork with curry sauce - tender inside, crunchy outside, and truly unique. A must-try dish at Com Ngon Siba!Crispy pork with curry sau\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 9, 2025",
